# Homebrew uses rolling releases, so the lockfile is not committed.
# https://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-bundle#versions-and-lockfiles
#
# `brew bundle` writes this next to whichever Brewfile it is handed. Normally that
# is the deployed copy under ~/.config/homebrew/ (covered separately by
# .chezmoiignore), but dotbot currently runs against the source tree, so guard here
# too.
dot_config/homebrew/Brewfile.lock.json
